  "description": "Brand new to the DK Bicycles lineup, the Devo kid’s bikes are the perfect first bicycle for kids on the go. Starting with a lightweight aluminum frame and rims, the Devo 12 is designed for smooth and stable riding as youngins get the feel for pedaling. The Devo comes stock with a sturdy set of training wheels, which are easily removed when the balance point is established. A full-coverage chainguard and an easy-to-use coaster brake provide for safe and steady riding. The quick release seat clamp makes adjusting the seat height easy and tool-free. With fun colorways that everyone will love, parents can make the most of the Devo for more than one kid. The Devo 12 is an easy choice for your kid’s first bike at a price that’s just right.\n\nTraining wheels included!\n\nPedals Plastic\n\nRims Alloy\n\nFront Hub Steel, loose ball\n\nRear Hub Steel, coaster brake\n\nTires 12x2.1” tires w/ inflatable tubes\n\nSeat 1-piece padded seat/post combo (seat artwork matches cross bar pad)\n\nSeat Post Integrated\n\nSeat Post Clamp Alloy\n\nTraining Wheels Steel w/ reinforcement bracket and PVC wheels\n\nWeight 14.8 lbs",
